  <p><i>(a) </i>the amendment shall for all purposes be deemed to form part ofthe specification along with other documents related thereto;</p>
  <p><i>(b) </i>the fact that the specification or any other docllillems related thereto has been amended shall De published as expeditiously as possible; and</p>
